            description: "Bulk antimatter storage vessel, medium. A geodesic-reinforced 20 m sphere whose containment field is powered directly by the ship's antimatter reactor — a runaway loop that nonetheless remains the most mass-efficient way to carry hundreds of tonnes of antimatter on a crewed vessel.",
